[{:db/id "q-42763/selection/f0a87de235e2364a210008d8df2b4bb2b8782ef7a84a43fd97ccbbe64a2c08d2" :answer/id #uuid "bf8969fe-d3de-5fe3-9748-568fa6bfc825" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{16}{15}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42763/selection/80f9bea33aa6a89d127ee9002c35787893c3c59b57df469ba089cea1a4a6a472" :answer/id #uuid "e07da5c9-9c7a-554b-9e60-61edd6f05ef3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42763/selection/b937b5a9c9148a5914243385a1d84bacb019d6c5ff771ce01182a0f3091b9285" :answer/id #uuid "0a65c723-ecfd-520f-b5bc-2f34d7789242" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42763/selection/b8b74e4dbac988e905d6dbb0fc26a9c023a0645606358d2cf4d35a077c103cc2" :answer/id #uuid "e1e83e49-c9fc-54bd-8627-2f3e52431ff9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{16}{\\sqrt{15}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42763/selection/1a1ac406ee7c898fc9bdce39d4ba7905d3f110abb680f643eb81fc9f9bf2ceaf" :answer/id #uuid "a237daec-9f6a-57ee-97e5-4630330b3586" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{256}{15}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42763/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "26a7015b-e5e6-5110-8f91-c272288cf3f6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-42763/selection/b8b74e4dbac988e905d6dbb0fc26a9c023a0645606358d2cf4d35a077c103cc2" :answer-field/choices ["q-42763/selection/f0a87de235e2364a210008d8df2b4bb2b8782ef7a84a43fd97ccbbe64a2c08d2" "q-42763/selection/80f9bea33aa6a89d127ee9002c35787893c3c59b57df469ba089cea1a4a6a472" "q-42763/selection/b937b5a9c9148a5914243385a1d84bacb019d6c5ff771ce01182a0f3091b9285" "q-42763/selection/b8b74e4dbac988e905d6dbb0fc26a9c023a0645606358d2cf4d35a077c103cc2" "q-42763/selection/1a1ac406ee7c898fc9bdce39d4ba7905d3f110abb680f643eb81fc9f9bf2ceaf"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-42763" :question/id #uuid "30169d9f-5a4b-5d98-acdf-194d4d7ec50a" :question/math-academy-id "q-42763" :question/problem "Let $V=C[0,2]$ be the vector space of all functions that are continuous on $[0,2],$ equipped with the inner product \n\n$$\n⟨x(t),y(t)⟩={\\int }_{0}^{2}x(t)y(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nCalculate the norm of the vector $f(t)=t+{t}^{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "The norm of a vector $f(t)$ with respect to an inner product $⟨\\cdot ,\\cdot ⟩$ is defined as\n\n$$\n‖f(t)‖=\\sqrt{⟨f(t),f(t)⟩}.\n$$\n\nComputing the inner product using our definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨f(t),f(t)⟩ & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}(f(t))^{2}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}(t+{t}^{2})^{2}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}({t}^{2}+2{t}^{3}+{t}^{4})\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={(\\frac{{t}^{3}}{3}+\\frac{{t}^{4}}{2}+\\frac{{t}^{5}}{5})|}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}+8+\\frac{32}{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{256}{15}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n‖f(t)‖=\\sqrt{\\frac{256}{15}}=\\frac{16}{\\sqrt{15}}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-42763/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "090d6747-55e2-548b-84f2-88f6c732518f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-42763"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-97426/selection/2c4d6e5441cbec03f3f39f0b70bf1a0cf4841f7fa8af46e7d427b67f4f11a481" :answer/id #uuid "f4183ccc-bcb7-58f6-9c3a-5ac61900f2b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{115}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97426/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "88f7ec97-011d-5439-9aa6-348d1703d4dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97426/selection/c961310a3bc781950858cd88cfba7959d0d487b62af56e846c2cdeea9c7b843b" :answer/id #uuid "a6bf2e42-d063-5c65-9c6c-7e8e09a41ede" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97426/selection/232c2c5cf400d32b3bc6da18fdbda2dce0b630394240283c4c579eec83a0463d" :answer/id #uuid "d32bb559-2b81-5393-860a-1283266fe2b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{105}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97426/selection/478cbf1ea235fbfb5b60a0837fffa0a678f83a3bcb8f958a024b0760ea2175ce" :answer/id #uuid "6c5123ec-b63c-59a4-87a5-37d261efb433" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97426/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "cf5e903a-5ce8-5190-a15e-7b3cce6b0034" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-97426/selection/2c4d6e5441cbec03f3f39f0b70bf1a0cf4841f7fa8af46e7d427b67f4f11a481" :answer-field/choices ["q-97426/selection/2c4d6e5441cbec03f3f39f0b70bf1a0cf4841f7fa8af46e7d427b67f4f11a481" "q-97426/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" "q-97426/selection/c961310a3bc781950858cd88cfba7959d0d487b62af56e846c2cdeea9c7b843b" "q-97426/selection/232c2c5cf400d32b3bc6da18fdbda2dce0b630394240283c4c579eec83a0463d" "q-97426/selection/478cbf1ea235fbfb5b60a0837fffa0a678f83a3bcb8f958a024b0760ea2175ce"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-97426" :question/id #uuid "b37d5348-c5f2-5d7d-bfb2-33bef9089323" :question/math-academy-id "q-97426" :question/problem "Let $V={R}_{2}[t]$ be the vector space of all polynomials of degree at most $2,$ equipped with the inner product\n\n$$\n⟨x(t),y(t)⟩=x(-2)y(-2)+x(0)y(0)+x(2)y(2).\n$$\n\nCalculate the norm of the vector $p(t)=3-t+{t}^{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "The norm of a vector $p(t)$ with respect to an inner product $⟨\\cdot ,\\cdot ⟩$ is defined as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖p(t)‖=\\sqrt{⟨p(t),p(t)⟩}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $p(t)=3-t+{t}^{2},$ we obtain\n\n$$\np(-2)=9,\\,p(0)=3,\\,p(2)=5.\n$$\n\nComputing $‖p(t)‖$ using our definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖p(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{⟨p(t),p(t)⟩} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{p(-2)p(-2)+p(0)p(0)+p(2)p(2)} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{[p(-2)]^{2}+[p(0)]^{2}+[p(2)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(9)^{2}+(3)^{2}+(5)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{81+9+25} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{115}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-97426/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5e023193-7494-5e3a-bd6e-e15ae0e9a1bd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-97426"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-97724/selection/ce77693bef346d30e01f1135b917b5d98be118e409b93037d8626cbfdbdf2482" :answer/id #uuid "c7d81493-e5b0-57c0-8153-c142c975537e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97724/selection/3819bff414160910dc1c86126778b8da9a818bc8d5220a56e4251cb3ee64569e" :answer/id #uuid "fa3833c7-7c3f-5b3c-9000-c0156dfd78f9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{31}}{31}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97724/selection/71f842b5216f52cc5e0b5d76c5bbefa47482a82e321f58b8c77ab94109f142bb" :answer/id #uuid "8e6314bc-4937-5ddc-89b1-27e04e346d45" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{13}}{13}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97724/selection/d413c396a92faf61269b326e3a450183d7e4839b7d59e5c27e2cba3c388499e1" :answer/id #uuid "9de771eb-62e3-5330-8685-6539c304fc37" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{14}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97724/selection/534fce7f9b63c39ec200045d152b721335ab0d357844993342f3592a60677f26" :answer/id #uuid "70db83a4-bda6-5ff6-9d51-054750eb4c2c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{14}}{14}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97724/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "5ed3ffe0-7be0-59e9-907f-a2033c2cdad5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-97724/selection/3819bff414160910dc1c86126778b8da9a818bc8d5220a56e4251cb3ee64569e" :answer-field/choices ["q-97724/selection/ce77693bef346d30e01f1135b917b5d98be118e409b93037d8626cbfdbdf2482" "q-97724/selection/3819bff414160910dc1c86126778b8da9a818bc8d5220a56e4251cb3ee64569e" "q-97724/selection/71f842b5216f52cc5e0b5d76c5bbefa47482a82e321f58b8c77ab94109f142bb" "q-97724/selection/d413c396a92faf61269b326e3a450183d7e4839b7d59e5c27e2cba3c388499e1" "q-97724/selection/534fce7f9b63c39ec200045d152b721335ab0d357844993342f3592a60677f26"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-97724" :question/id #uuid "89dfaeb6-595c-5446-b274-cea99af3ddca" :question/math-academy-id "q-97724" :question/problem "An inner product on $V={R}^{3}$ is defined as $⟨x,y⟩={x}_{1}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}+2{x}_{3}{y}_{3}.$ \n\nNormalize the  vector $v=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$ under this inner product." :question/worked-solution "The norm of a vector $v$ with respect to an inner product $⟨\\cdot ,\\cdot ⟩$ is defined as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖v‖=\\sqrt{⟨v,v⟩}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the inner product using our definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨v,v⟩ & =1\\cdot 1+3\\cdot (2\\cdot 2)+2\\cdot (3\\cdot 3) \\\\  & =1+12+18 \\\\  & =31.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖v‖ & =\\sqrt{31}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo normalize the vector $v$, we divide $v$ by its norm $‖v‖:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u & =\\frac{v}{‖v‖} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{31}}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{31}}{31}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-97724/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "466fb505-1ff3-5b27-a5f7-0ea5b31b2927"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-97724"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
